    "$notes": {
      "dark": "After Apple's Human Interface Guidelines: layered greys for depth (systemBackground, secondary, tertiary, quaternary), one tint. brand is paper white for the main action (Generate); accent is the blue of the logo's frame. chrome, glass, scrim and toast are bars and panels over content; heroFrom/heroTo the soft gradient behind big cards.",
      "light": "Darker than Apple's own greys and colours, so text keeps a 4.5:1 contrast on white (WCAG AA); faint grey (3:1) is only for chevrons, placeholders and what is switched off."
    }
